flowchart TD
    A[Restaurant Admin Login] --> B[Authenticated restaurant_admin]
    B --> C[requireManagedRestaurant]
    C --> D[Own Restaurant Menu]
    D --> E[Select 3D-enabled Dish]
    E --> F[Load named GLB layers + current structured config]
    F --> G[Edit participation / XYZ offsets / order / duration / stagger / easing preset]
    G --> H[Preview Explode / Assemble]
    H --> I{Save?}
    I -- No --> G
    I -- Reset --> J[Restore model/default animation config]
    J --> H
    I -- Yes --> K[Backend validates scope + bounds + allowlists]
    K --> L{Valid?}
    L -- No --> M[Reject with safe validation message]
    M --> G
    L -- Yes --> N[Save MenuItem.threeD animation metadata]
    N --> O[Public 3D dish uses saved configuration]
    O --> P[DOM/poster fallback remains available]

    Q[Platform Admin] -. no access .-> G
    R[Arbitrary JS/CSS/Shader] -. rejected .-> K
